<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-UNIBANKA SLIPS FURTHER AFTER DIVIDEND PAYMENT.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-UNIBANKA SLIPS FURTHER AFTER DIVIDEND PAYMENT.</headline>
